{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>space survival builder</strong>. You've crash-landed on an asteroid, and your O\u2082 supply is running low. Build a survival base quickly, repair your ship, and escape. Will you survive the vast emptiness of space?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore &amp; Mine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dig Deep into the Asteroid:</strong> Excavate the asteroid's core and uncover precious ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/0001-0400_1_.gif?t=1749633699\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Establish a Secure Outpost:</strong> Create a functional base to escape the harsh realities of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/0001-0339.gif?t=1749633699\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the Void</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage Your Oxygen Supply:</strong> In the unforgiving vacuum of space, oxygen is your most critical resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/2025-05-07_17-36-46.gif?t=1749633699\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607150?t=1749633699","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607150?t=1749633699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/4cea80a95893e31c3ee0c925eef05ea7bddd019b/cap